@startuml
title Online Quiz System - State Diagram

[*] --> Registered
Registered --> [*]

state "Registered" as Registered {
    state "Logged In As Teacher" as LoggedInTeacher
    state "Logged In As Student" as LoggedInStudent
}

Registered --> LoggedInTeacher : login as teacher / verify credentials
Registered --> LoggedInStudent : login as student / verify credentials

LoggedInTeacher --> CreateQuiz : create new quiz / assign questions
LoggedInTeacher --> EditQuiz : edit existing quiz / update questions
LoggedInTeacher --> SaveDraft : save quiz as draft / store in database
LoggedInTeacher --> PostQuiz : post quiz for students / notify users
LoggedInTeacher --> ViewResults : view quiz results / retrieve from database

LoggedInStudent --> SelectQuiz : select a quiz to answer / retrieve available quizzes
LoggedInStudent --> AnswerQuiz : answer selected quiz / submit answers
LoggedInStudent --> SubmitQuiz : submit answered quiz / store in database
LoggedInStudent --> ViewResult : view result of submitted quiz / retrieve from database

@enduml
